{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_08_beg","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_08","title":"月光沉淪","storyCode":"TW-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"941f4e46b8e4dfea061a96c88f1415d9754fa2ad161253a8364d0411fd52105e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"被燒死的鎮民觸動了塔佳娜的神經，因為嫌疑人之死感到迷茫的亞葉被迫走上戰場。羅德島面對整合運動的薩卡茲，泥岩小隊。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 8上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜！最後一個“留聲機”被破壞了！我們沒有手段對付那些巨人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！那些暴徒開始燒房子了！該死，他們......火勢在蔓延！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，塔佳娜，塞弗林呢！這種關鍵時候，他在哪裡！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林長官他......他受了傷，他正在休息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"都什麼時候了還休息！？我們可是冒著生命危險——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！現在不是吵架的時候，沒看我們處於劣勢嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的法術有用嗎！？廢物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別吵了！控制好各自的管轄區域，防禦性的源石技藝必須保證——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"東邊！東邊的術師倒下了！快換一個頂上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"小心——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"火——！火燒過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"救——救命啊啊啊——啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快、快滅火！有沒有可以滅火的術師！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救——疼，疼啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜——救——我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"清晰的字句很快被單純的慘叫遮掩。\n皮膚烤焦的味道，比任何惡劣的玩笑都要讓人膽寒。\n被火焰包裹著的人逐漸失去形貌，只留下黑影似的肉體......\n焦黑的皮膚和血，他掙扎著開口——\n他很痛苦，他請求我幫助他。\n但是——\n但是——托爾當時，也是這樣痛苦的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜！！別恍神了，你離太遠了！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"好機會！你也一起被燒死吧！貴族的寵物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"混亂。這座城鎮從來都不是上下一心的，就像蛋糕，切成一塊一塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，那最後的一塊也將要變成一盤散沙，他們毫無力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我們收手，就算我們撤退，他們當真能活下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞必然會棄他們於不顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"離這裡最近的兩座移動城邦，二十四座高塔，沒有一個大人物能俯瞰到冬靈山脈裡垂死掙扎的小城鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——悲哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我們曾是厭倦了這種悲哀，而站在這裡，不要忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"不要試圖自作主張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然。誒，你平時怎麼不這麼講話呢？我只是抱怨抱怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"抱怨我們等待隱忍了那麼久，最後的結果也沒什麼變化，事情還是變得很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一點不甘心的......牢騷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"他們要衝進來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我來幫忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！好不容易轟開的缺口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"那個沃爾珀是哪兒來的！？她、她怎麼有九條尾巴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"不對！你也是感染者！你為什麼要站在那裡！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼小的年紀——你的不幸和痛苦，難道就不該反抗嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞！反抗他們！不要被騙了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"他們才是壓榨我們欺壓我們的罪人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"你——在說什麼啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"把、把他們給震飛了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"她周圍的源石技藝反應變慢了？這是哪個國家的法術，書上沒有教過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"不要隨便就決定別人的命運啊，羅德島的前輩們，還有爸爸媽媽，大家都對我很好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你們！不要偷偷溜過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！？身、身體......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"不要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——總是不顧後果地讓事情變成最壞的情況啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......現在你打算怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"畢德曼......罪魁禍首已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"斷崖和卡達回來之前，我們還沒有確實的證據......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼真凶到底是誰？在我眼前發生的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"現在沒空討論這個問題，至少先鎮壓這場暴亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——亞葉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不知道該怎麼做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......我理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"一個救治感染者的醫師，卻死在感染者暴亂之中的那種荒唐和無力感......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾比任何人......都為之憤恨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼、為什麼一定要這樣？大家不都知道現在的情況嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"自相殘殺沒有好處！大家會一起遭殃的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"給我讓開！否則就算你是小孩，我也不會讓你好受的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——我不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"你們應該聽我說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想說什麼？要從頭開始梳理誰對誰錯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得是什麼把我們逼到這個份上的？時代、國家、人心，什麼都很糟糕，自以為有些想法的人都會這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，假如現在你走在路上，有一個暴徒持刀攔路，逼問你他該如何活下去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時候你要從哪裡說起？從萊塔尼亞的腐敗制度，還是雷姆必拓的血腥開拓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！快要支撐——不住——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"他想的是怎麼殺了你開闢一條生路，而你想的是要立刻開火還是想辦法拉開距離再開火——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"想要活下去的大部分時候，事實就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"總有一些渺小的人要犧牲，恰好都是我們這樣的人，而不是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"你們高枕無憂，暢談理想，譴責時代，把話題變大，把敵人變遙遠，來逃避近在眼前的問題——哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"——有效果了！繼續衝擊防線！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......可大家都是無辜的......感染者也不是自己樂意才......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"無辜？呸，我才不想取得同情，我們都不是無辜的。去他媽的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是要活下去，哪怕讓其他人活不下去，在活命這方面，沒有人是搞慈善的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！那個沃爾珀好像快不行了，九條尾巴的那隻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊瞄準她！快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"噫——法、法杖斷了？從哪兒來的弩箭！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來幫忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"斷崖和卡達應該在外圍疏散被捲入的民眾，至於我們就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——亞葉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實聽見，人群之中有在高喊，整合運動解放了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"失去了主心骨，這場暴亂自會瓦解！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底，要不是因為他們，安托怎麼會——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這對你來說並不是第一次了，對我來說......也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我有點......不知所措。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......上吧，羅德島要想辦法阻止這場暴亂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......是羅德島，你寄予厚望的，就是這幾個孩子而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還不成熟，他們沒來得及阻止這一切，已經晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......但他們，已是戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"戰士，已經走上了戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"讓其他人退下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我們上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲一把扯下了整合運動的標誌，她揚起手，岩石瓦解，又再度匯聚。\n戰場陷入寂靜，暴亂者們自覺地讓出道路，抗爭者則因為膽怯而後退。\n只見她向前，邁出了一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["鈴蘭"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
